B.asn=new A.c0("weapon_reaction_Impaling","Impaling","[Reaction] After you Succeed on a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Str. On Success give the target {Source} d6 bleed and dash the target to a free space in reach of your weapon and the target is restrained and moves with you until the start of your next turn. If your Impaled Target dies, you may Make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting an enemy range {Source}. On Success, fling the body at them deals {Source d12} damage. On Problems, the body lands adjacent to the target.",B.ai,B.e2)
