B.ash=new A.c0("weapon_reaction_Dueler","Dueler","[Reaction], When you succeed on a Melee Attack, Spend your reaction and the target has disadvantage on attacks that don\u2019t include you and you have disadvantage on attacks that don\u2019t include the target. You and the Target get a +1 to defense results from characters not involved in the duel. This lasts until one of you dies, the situation ends, or you duel another character. When you stop a duel by dueling another, any targets no longer dueled by you gain +1 to attacks against you until the end of their next turn.",B.ai,B.cF)
B.ass=new A.c0("weapon_reaction_Backup","Backup","[Reaction], When you start your turn, you may spend your Reaction, and target an enemy in your weapons range and make a technique Attack. On Success, Push the target {Source} and they may not target you with opportunity attacks until the end of your turn.",B.ai,B.cF)
