B.asb=new A.c0("weapon_reaction_Throw","Throw","[Reaction] During an enemies turn when they are range 3, spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Dex. On problems, your weapon lands in a space adjacent to the target. On success, the weapon is impaled in the target, and while impaled, you and your allies have +1 to range attacks against the target. For each weapon impaled, the target gets a -1 penalty to speed. The target or an adjacent creature can pull out all the impaled weapons as an item interaction and the target gains {Source} d6 bleed per weapon. Passive, you have a total of {Half Level} extra of these weapons each situation and each time you use a supply to restock.",B.ai,B.cF)
