B.Sg=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_big_spill","Big spill","You may instead target each enemy in a 1 space radius range 6 instead. On success, knock the target prone.")
B.TZ=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_protection_penetrator","Protection Penetrator","The burn ignores Shields. When the target takes damage from this burn, remove shield equal to the burn.")
B.PQ=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_unreasonably_concentrated","Unreasonably Concentrated","The target and their allies must succeed an Int Defense check when they use an action to remove the burn. The target and their allies have disadvantage when they spend a [Reaction] action to end this burning.")
B.a4D=s([B.Sg,B.TZ,B.PQ],t.U)
B.X5=new A.ah("feature_acid_splash","Acid Splash","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4/8. On success, the target gains {Source} d6 Burn vs Int. This burn damage ignores Resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and give the targets {Half Source}d6 Burn vs Int. This burn ignores resistance.",B.D,B.a4D,!1)
B.Sd=new A.m("feature_annihilation_absorption","Absorption","On Success with the action, Before damage, Gain {Half Source d6} shield and reduce the target\u2019s shield by the same amount.")
B.Qu=new A.m("feature_annihilation_destabilize","Destabilize","On Success with the action, until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on success with attacks against the target.")
B.U3=new A.m("feature_annihilation_demoralize","Demoralize","On Success with the action, until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on attacks that target you.")
B.a6n=s([B.Sd,B.Qu,B.U3],t.U)
B.W9=new A.ah("feature_annihilation","Annihilation","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range 1, on success deal {Source d10} Damage ignoring shields and resistance and until the start of your next turn, if the target dies, They respawn at Half Health. If the target has an instead of death ability, reduce their new Health total by half.\n\n[Reaction] When a creature range 1 dies, [Reaction] and The target respawns at half health. If the target has an instead of death effect, reduce their new Health total by half.",B.D,B.a6n,!1)
B.Ti=new A.m("feature_attach_absorption","Absorption","When you succeed on an attach attack vs an enemy gain {Source d6} Shield. When you are attached to an ally, they may use your shield when attacked.")
B.Un=new A.m("feature_attach_burrowing","Burrowing","When an enemy starts their turn with you attached, they gain {Half Source} d6 Bleed. When an ally starts their turn with you attached, They take {Half Source d6} damage and they gain {Half Source} d12 Regeneration.")
B.V7=new A.m("feature_attach_scuttling","Scuttling","When an enemy ends their turn with you attached, make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, force them to move {Source}. When an ally ends their turn with you attached, force them to move {Half Source}.")
B.a78=s([B.Ti,B.Un,B.V7],t.U)
B.Xq=new A.ah("feature_attach","Attach","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy range 1, On Success deal {Source d12} and Until the start of your next turn you are attached to the target, gaining +1 to Defense results. Whenever the target changes spaces, you follow them, dashing to a free space adjacent to them. You may only be attached to 1 creature at a time. You may target an ally, On Success, give them {Source d6} Shield instead and you attach to them, regardless of success.\n\n[Reaction] During you or your allies turns, attach to that ally until the start of your next turn. When you Succeed on a Melee Attack or Fail with an Attach attack, [Reaction] to attach to one of the targets.",B.D,B.a78,!1)
B.T7=new A.m("feature_aura_natural","Natural","You have +1 to success on your Aura Status Check and to concentrate on your aura.")
B.S8=new A.m("feature_aura_large","Large","Your Aura affects enemies within 3 spaces of you instead.")
B.V3=new A.m("feature_aura_pulse","Pulse","[Action] While you are concentrating on your aura, Make an attack as if you had just activated the aura.")
B.Qp=new A.m("feature_aura_explosive","Explosive","When your Aura Ends, Make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting every enemy in your aura. On a Success Deal {Half Source d10} damage.")
B.a3i=s([B.T7,B.S8,B.V3,B.Qp],t.U)
B.Wh=new A.ah("feature_aura","Aura","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting Enemies range 1. On Success deal {Source d8}.\n For as long as you remain Concentrating, You radiate an aura. Whenever an enemy starts their turn or first enters a square adjacent to you each round, Make an Status Check Vs Vit, On Success, They take {Half Source d6} damage.\n\n[Reaction] Start of the Situation, or start of the first combat round when not surprised, spend your reaction and begin concentrating on your aura.",B.D,B.a3i,!1)
B.S9=new A.m("feature_banish_cast_out","Cast Out","If you target an adjacent enemy, you do not attack with disadvantage, and if you Succeed with the action, the target is knocked prone. If you fail on an attack against an adjacent enemy, you may push the target up to {Half Source} Spaces away.")
B.TY=new A.m("feature_banish_exile","Exile","On Success with the action, Until the start of your next turn, the target may not move toward you. On Success with the reaction, until the start of the target ally\u2019s next turn, the target enemy may not move toward the target ally.")
B.QB=new A.m("feature_banish_pariah","Pariah","On Success with the action or reaction, The target has disadvantage on attacks if there is a creature adjacent to them until the start of your next turn.")
B.a4t=s([B.S9,B.TY,B.QB],t.U)
B.WM=new A.ah("feature_banish","Banish","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha targeting an enemy range 6/12, On a Success, deal {Source d10} damage, And push the target up to {Source} spaces away from you, and until the start of your next you have resistance to damage from the target.\n\n[Reaction] After an enemy succeeds a Melee Attack against an ally range {Source}, Deal {Half Source d10} damage and push the target up to {Source} Spaces away.",B.D,B.a4t,!1)
B.al=new A.Ru(1,"allies")
B.V5=new A.m("bard_upgrade_learn_2_songs_1",u._,u._)
B.V6=new A.m("bard_upgrade_learn_2_songs_2",u._,u._)
B.RH=new A.m("bard_upgrade_favorite_song","Favorite Song","When you start the song, pick one of your allies. When the target uses your Song effect, they gain a {Half Power} Source mod to their use of the song effect.")
B.T_=new A.m("bard_upgrade_hum_along","Hum Along","When one of your allies starts their turn in range of the song, and hadn\u2019t used their reaction, they gain {Half source d6} Shield.")
B.Rf=new A.m("bard_upgrade_dance_track","Dance Track","When an ally starts their turn in your song area, they gain a {Half Source} bonus to speed.")
B.a5l=s([B.V5,B.V6,B.RH,B.T_,B.Rf],t.U)
B.Wx=new A.ah("feature_bard","Bard","Sing [Reaction] During your or an ally\u2019s turn, You Sing one of the bard songs you know. As long as you are Concentrating on Singing, You and your allies range 6 spaces, may trigger your bard song effect using a [reaction] during their turn. While singing you cannot hide. When you pick this learn 1 bard song. While singing, at the start of your turn, you may change which song you are singing, to another song you know.",B.al,B.a5l,!1)
B.Ua=new A.m("feature_barrier_enchanting","Enchanting","You may force all characters in the area to move {Half Source}")
B.Rn=new A.m("feature_barrier_shielding","Shielding","Until the start of your next turn, targets gain resistance to damage as long as they have shield.")
B.SK=new A.m("feature_barrier_distraction","Distraction","Until the start of your next turn, you and your allies gain +1 to defense results from enemies who were in the area.")
B.a4N=s([B.Ua,B.Rn,B.SK],t.U)
B.X_=new A.ah("feature_barrier","Barrier","[Action] Target a {Half Source} radius range 6 and make a Status Check vs Cha. On Success, you and allies in the area gain {Source d8} shield.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of an enemies turn, Target a {Half Source} radius range 6 and you and allies in the area gain {Half Source d8} shield.",B.D,B.a4N,!1)
B.QX=new A.m("feature_battle_trance_unstoppable","Unstoppable","While concentrating and have at least 1 shield, you have +1 to Concentration and Attack results.")
B.UZ=new A.m("feature_battle_trance_indomitable","Indomitable","You gain resistance to damage from attacks that target Wis, Int, Cha.")
B.Qb=new A.m("feature_battle_trance_frenzy","Frenzy","While in your Battle Trance, gain a bonus {Half Source} Speed and Advantage on Defending Provoked Attacks.")
B.a4X=s([B.QX,B.UZ,B.Qb],t.U)
B.Wy=new A.ah("feature_battle_trance","Battle Trance","[Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction and gain {Source d6} Shield. You enter a Battle Trance for as long as you remain concentrating, You gain damage resistance against Str, Dex, Vit, and at the end of your turn, After burn, you gain {Half Source d6} Shield.\n\n[Reaction] After you succeed on a Defense caused by an enemy range {Source}, spend your reaction and deal {Half Source d6} and you may reduce your shield by up to the same amount to deal twice the amount of shield lost as bonus damage.",B.D,B.a4X,!1)
B.ST=new A.m("feature_beam_blinding","Blinding","On Success with either, the targets gets a -1 penalty to attack results until the start of your next turn")
B.Ro=new A.m("feature_beam_finisher","Finisher","On Success with an action against a target that was successfully attacked by one of your allies this round, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage. Reaction, if the ally succeeded the attack, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.")
B.V1=new A.m("feature_beam_split","Split","Also attack another Target within 2 spaces of the original target.")
B.a4W=s([B.ST,B.Ro,B.V1],t.U)
B.VW=new A.ah("feature_beam","Beam","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting one enemy range 6/12. On a Success, deal {Source d12} damage.\n\n[Reaction] After an ally succeeds an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and target one of the targets range 6/12 and deal {Half Source d12} damage.",B.D,B.a4W,!1)
B.Te=new A.m("feature_body_of_stone_rock_hard","Rock Hard","While Concentrating, you gain resistance to attacks targeting Str, Dex, or Vit.")
B.Rt=new A.m("feature_body_of_stone_weighty_blows","Weighty Blows","While Concentrating, Your Melee attacks get a -1 penalty to attack results but deal an extra {Half Source d6} Damage.")
B.TB=new A.m("feature_body_of_stone_shatter","Shatter","On success, the target has disadvantage on defenses until the end of your next turn.")
B.a7s=s([B.Te,B.Rt,B.TB],t.U)
B.Xh=new A.ah("feature_body_of_stone","Body of Stone","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an Enemy Range 1. On Success, they take {Source d10} Damage. Regardless, as long as you are concentrating, gain +1 to defense results and reduce your speed by 1 space. As long as you are concentrating you may repeat the attack as an [Action].\n\n[Reaction] When you fail a Str, Dex or Vit Defense, spend your reaction and gain resistance to the damage. You may begin concentrating on your body of stone.",B.D,B.a7s,!1)
B.Tu=new A.m("feature_bramble_grabbing_vines","Grabbing Vines","When you Succeed with the Status Checks, the Target is restrained until the start of your turn.")
B.Uo=new A.m("feature_bramble_thicket","Thicket","The area is not difficult terrain for you and your allies, and while in the area, you and your allies resist damage from ranged attacks.")
B.Um=new A.m("feature_bramble_pollen","Pollen","While concentrating, [Action] target each enemy in and within 2 of the area and make a Melee Attack Vs Vit. On success, deal {Source d8} damage.")
B.QV=new A.m("feature_bramble_poison_ivy","Poison Ivy","When you succeed with the status check, the target gains {Source} d6 Burn vs Wis.")
B.a7A=s([B.Tu,B.Uo,B.Um,B.QV],t.U)
B.VX=new A.ah("feature_bramble","Bramble","[Action] Target a {Half Source} space radius Range {6 + Source}, As long as you remain concentrating, The area becomes overgrown with thorny plants and counts as difficult terrain. The first time each enemy moves into a space in the area each round, make an Status Check vs Wis, On Success they take {Source d6} damage.\n\n[Reaction] When a creature enters or starts their turn in difficult terrain, spend your reaction and the target takes {Half Source d6} and is restrained until the end of their turn.",B.D,B.a7A,!1)
B.SF=new A.m("feature_brawler_buddy","Buddy","On Success with the action, The target must remain adjacent to you until the start of your next turn. If you move they come with, if they move you come with. These moves don\u2019t provoke.")
B.S6=new A.m("feature_brawler_moshpit","MoshPit","When an enemy provokes an attack, you may use 1 of your Defense advantage Rolls to make an Unarmed Melee Attack vs Dex, On Success: Deal {Half Source d6} Damage. Note: This doesn\u2019t use your reaction nor does it trigger buddy.")
B.SB=new A.m("feature_brawler_star","Star","You may instead use an implement instead of an unarmed attack. You also make Implement attacks with MoshPit. When you use an implement, increase the damage to {Source d10}.")
