B.Xv=new A.ah("feature_brawler","Brawler","[Action: Unarmed] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting 1 enemy range 1, On Success, Deal {Source d6}. Regardless, Until the start of your next turn, you gain advantage on your next {Half Source} defense rolls.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed a defense from a Melee Attack, spend your reaction or 1 defense bonus to deal the source of the attack {Half Source d6} damage.",B.D,B.a5B,!1)
