B.W7=new A.ah("feature_generator","Generator","[Action] Target a free space within 1 and place a generator there. The generator counts as a barrier and supply can be used as if it was made by a skill. As long as it lasts, when you or your allies start their turn or become within 2 during their turn, they gain {Source d6} shield. You may only benefit from 1 Generator per round.\n\n[Reaction] During Allies Turns, Spend your reaction and target you and allies who are range {Source} of either you, or your generator, and they gain {Half Source d6} Shield.",B.al,B.a5g,!1)
B.SC=new A.m("feature_ghost_ghost_touch","Ghost Touch","While in shadow form from the action, at the end of the target's turn, make a Status Check vs Wis. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to each enemy you passed through this turn.")
