B.X6=new A.ah("feature_glory","Glory","[Reaction] During your or ally turns, target yourself or an ally range 1. While you remain concentrating, whenever the target succeeds with an attack, the target deals {Half Source d6} extra damage that ignores shield and resistance. On problems with an attack, the target takes {Half Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance then they gain half that much shield.\n\n[Reaction] Before you or an ally you can see makes an attack during their turn, spend your reaction. If the target Succeeds, they gain {Source d6} bonus damage and the attack ignores shield and resistance. On Problems, the target takes {Source d6} damage then gains half as much shield.",B.al,B.a5p,!1)
B.Rh=new A.m("feature_grappling_hook_scoop","Scoop","When you target through an ally's space, you may bring those allies along, dashing them to a free space adjacent to your destination. If you pull an enemy through an ally, they ride the enemy and instead dash to a free space adjacent to the enemy.")
B.Tc=new A.m("feature_grappling_hook_trip","Trip","When you target a free space through any enemies, make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, knock the targets prone. When you succeed on attacking an enemy and there are enemies between you, knock them prone.")
B.T9=new A.m("feature_grappling_hook_night","The Night","On success, if you are able to hide at your destination, you may make a conceal check. On success, you are hidden.")
B.Qy=new A.m("feature_grappling_hook_swing","Swing","On Success, instead of dashing to the space, you may dash in a circle staying the same distance from the target space. You may dash to any point on the circle. If you have scoop, you scoop allies you swing into. If you have trip, you may trip enemies you swing into.")
