B.PT=new A.m("feature_forced_martyrdom_masochism","Masochism","[Reaction] When you have to make a defense roll, you may spend your reaction to automatically fail the defense roll and the target takes full damage instead of half. You otherwise take half damage and are affected by the attack as normal.")
