B.VZ=new A.ah("feature_forced_martyrdom","Forced Martyrdom","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, Deal {source d8} Damage and you resist all damage from attacks. When you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Miss the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, spend your reaction and target one of the targets of the triggering attack. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Wis and you resist all damage from attacks and when you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Problems the effect ends.\n\nIf you have multiple targets affected by this at once, choose when you take damage which target takes the damage with you.",B.D,B.a47,!1)
B.RO=new A.m("feature_illusions_behind_the_curtain","Behind the Curtain","You and your allies can move through your illusions without breaking them. You and your allies may end your turn inside your illusion walls, preventing them from being able to be targeted by enemies as long as there is an illusion. If an enemy would be able to target a creature under your illusion with an ability, they can target the illusions in the spaces instead.")
B.Tt=new A.m("feature_illusions_disillusionment","Disillusionment","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, make a status check vs Int. On success, deal {Source d6} damage to the destroying enemy.")
B.PP=new A.m("feature_illusions_smoke_and_mirrors","Smoke and Mirrors","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, you or your allies adjacent to the illusions gain +1 to defense results until the start of their next turn. [Reaction] When you or your allies are adjacent to an illusion and are targeted by an attack, they can spend their reaction to force them to target the illusion instead.")
B.U2=new A.m("feature_illusions_unnerving_movement","Unnerving Movement","While concentrating, at the start of any turn, spend your [Reaction] target 1 illusion and move it {Source} spaces then make a status check vs Int targeting enemies range {Source} of the illusion. On success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.a5i=s([B.RO,B.Tt,B.PP,B.U2],t.U)
B.Wu=new A.ah("feature_illusions","Illusions","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int: On a Success, create up to {Source} spaces worth of illusions that last as long as you remain concentrating. Each space of illusions follows the wall rules from skills. You may create barriers instead of walls, creating 2 spaces of barrier for 1 space of wall. Your illusions are destroyed when hit by a single attack. You and your allies may move through your illusions causing them to be destroyed.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of a turn, spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, create up to {Source} Spaces worth of illusions.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the ability, you may add new illusions to the concentration. ",B.D,B.a5i,!1)
B.RM=new A.m("feature_inspiration_rage","Rage","When an ally fails on an attack, defense, or skill using inspiration, deal {Source d6} damage targeting an enemy range 1 of them or you.")
B.RE=new A.m("feature_inspiration_hope","Hope","When an ally succeeds on a defense using inspiration, give you and your allies {Half Source d6} shield.")
B.T4=new A.m("feature_inspiration_valor","Valor","Once each round, after you are damaged by an attack, each of your allies with inspiration gains {Source/3 d6} shield.")
B.a5e=s([B.RM,B.RE,B.T4],t.U)
B.WC=new A.ah("feature_inspiration","Inspiration","Inspire [Reaction]: After you or an ally you see succeeds on a check or attack during their turn, target {Source} allies and give them an Inspiration. When they would make an attack, defense, or skill roll, they may spend the inspiration to gain advantage. All inspiration is lost at the end of the situation.\n\nInspiring Valor [Action]: Make either a Melee Attack vs Str range 1 or a Ranged Attack vs Dex range 4. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to an enemy in range and all allies range {Source} gain shield equal to half the damage you deal.",B.al,B.a5e,!1)
B.Tv=new A.m("feature_jinx_doom","Doom","While concentrating, at the end of the round, spend your [Reaction] make a Ranged Attack vs Cha. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to each enemy affected by your jinx.")
B.QJ=new A.m("feature_jinx_confusion","Confusion","You and your allies gain a +1 to defense results caused by jinxed enemies.")
B.QK=new A.m("feature_jinx_sleepy","Sleepy","Jinxed enemies reduce their speed by {Half Source} and cannot use the [Retreat] action.")
B.a4r=s([B.Tv,B.QJ,B.QK],t.U)
B.Xp=new A.ah("feature_jinx","Jinx","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha targeting each enemy range {1+Source}. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and as long as you remain concentrating, Jinx the targets. While Jinxed, you and all your allies have advantage on attacks against the targets.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and all the targets of the origin attack take {Half Source d6} and are jinxed as long as you are concentrating.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the power again, you may add the targeted enemies to the group you are concentrating on.",B.D,B.a4r,!1)
B.Vt=new A.m("feature_justice_holy_fire","Holy Fire","Enemies damaged by justice also gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Cha.")
B.PR=new A.m("feature_justice_smiting","Smiting","Instead of targeting an enemy range 1 for damage with the action, choose 1 enemy in the situation.")
B.Rj=new A.m("feature_justice_overprotective","Overprotective","For Each HP of healing beyond the targets max hp, grant them 1 Shield up to {2 * Source}. This shield doesn\u2019t cause extra damage, unless you also deal the extra damage to yourself.")
B.a4p=s([B.Vt,B.PR,B.Rj],t.U)
B.Xe=new A.ah("feature_justice","Justice","'[Action] Target an ally range 3 and make a Status Check vs Cha, On Success: Heal the target {Source d6}, and target an enemy range 1 from that ally and deal damage equal to the amount the ally was healed. Allies may not be healed over their max HP. Enemies are only damaged by the amount of HP the ally regains. This ability may deal 0 damage.\n\n[Reaction] After an ally fails a defense from an attack, spend your reaction, Deal {Half Source d6} damage to the attacking enemy and heal the target by the same amount. This happens after the attack is completed.",B.al,B.a4p,!1)
B.SP=new A.m("lay_on_hands_righteous","Righteous","Until the end of your next turn, you deal extra damage on all attacks equal to the amount of HP you lost when using Lay on Hands.")
B.QA=new A.m("lay_on_hands_sacrifice","Sacrifice","You may concentrate on your Lay on Hands. As long as you do, at the end of your turn, lose {Source} HP and the target gains {2 * Source} HP. If this damage would cause you to die, the target regains all their health.")
B.TU=new A.m("lay_on_hands_witness","Witness","All allies not targeted that can see you use Lay on Hands gain shield equal to the HP you lost.")
B.a56=s([B.SP,B.QA,B.TU],t.U)
B.VV=new A.ah("lay_on_hands","Lay on Hands","[Action]: Target an Ally within range 1. You may lose HP up to {2 * Source}, and heal the target for twice that amount. Targeted Ally also gains {Source d12} Shield if you lose at least {Source} HP.\n\n[Reaction]: During ally turns when the ally is within range 1, spend your reaction and trigger your Lay on Hands.",B.al,B.a56,!1)
B.Vc=new A.m("feature_lightning_charger","Charger","You may target yourself or allies with the repeat attack. Instead of damage, give them {Source d6} shield. You may not target yourself or any ally more than once. When you use your reaction, you and allies adjacent to any of the targets gain {Half Source d6} shield.")
B.Qs=new A.m("feature_lightning_growing_static","Growing Static","On success with the action, give the last target in the chain 1d6 Burn vs Vit for every {6 - Power} enemies targeted.")
B.PY=new A.m("feature_lightning_grounded","Grounded","Targets cannot stand from prone until the start of your next turn.")
B.a7S=s([B.Vc,B.Qs,B.PY],t.U)
B.WE=new A.ah("feature_lightning","Lightning","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting an enemy range 3. On success, target another enemy range 3 of that enemy. Repeat targeting enemies range 3 of the last target, never targeting an enemy more than once until out of targets. Deal {Source d6} damage to all targets and knock the targets prone.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally range 4 succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and target all of the targets of the triggering attack, deal {Half Source d6} + 1d6 for each enemy targeted beyond the first and knock them prone.",B.D,B.a7S,!1)
B.SG=new A.m("feature_mind_control_battered_mind","Battered Mind","On success, deal {source d8} damage to the target.")
B.QS=new A.m("feature_mind_control_pion","Pion","while concentrating, [Reaction] if an attack would target you and the target is within {Half Source} of you, Spend your reaction and have the attack target the target instead. Then make a concentrating check as if you had taken damage.")
B.UH=new A.m("feature_mind_control_traitor","Traitor","the target has advantage on attacks against their allies.")
B.a7m=s([B.SG,B.QS,B.UH],t.U)
B.Xg=new A.ah("feature_mind_control","Mind Control","[Action] make a Ranged Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range {Source}. On success, for as long as you remain concentrating you are disabled and the target is mind controlled. At the start of their turn, make a status check vs Int, on success you control them on their turn. On failure the enemy is disabled this turn and the effect ends. \n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally Succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, 1 of the targets is mind controlled as long as you concentrate.",B.D,B.a7m,!1)
B.Sy=new A.m("feature_minkisi_witch_doctor","Witch Doctor","While concentrating, During your turn [Reaction] if the target is under a status effect that requires an ongoing check, have the target immediately make the check with advantage. The target may instead end burn or bleed. If the target is targeted by a poppet ability, the source of the poppet must make a concentration check.")
B.Rw=new A.m("feature_minkisi_witch_trap","Witch Trap","While concentrating, [reaction] when the target fails an Int, Wis, or Cha defense from an attack, you may spend your reaction to have the attacker become the target of the attack instead of the target, suffering the damage and adverse effects from the attack. ")
B.St=new A.m("feature_minkisi_zombie","Zombie","While concentrating, the target gains resistance to damage that targets Int, Wis or Cha.")
B.a4S=s([B.Sy,B.Rw,B.St],t.U)
B.Wc=new A.ah("feature_minkisi","Minkisi","[Action]: Target an ally in the initiative and make a status check. On success, make a minkisi that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. When you succeed, heal the target {Source d6} HP. The minkisi requires a hand to carry. Whenever you end your turn holding the minkisi, heal the target {Half Source d6}. \n\n[Reaction] During Ally turns, when they are range 1. Spend your reaction and take the minkisi action targeting the ally.\n\n[Reaction] While concentrating on a minkisi, during the target\u2019s turn, Spend your reaction and choose an ally within {Half Source} of the minkisi target and make a Status check. On Success heal the chosen ally {Source d6}.\n",B.al,B.a4S,!1)
B.R8=new A.m("feature_mirror_blurring","Blurring","while concentrating, After a clone is broken, you gain a +1 to defense results until the start of your next turn.")
B.TV=new A.m("feature_mirror_phantom_attacks","Phantom Attacks","when you succeed on an attack, deal 1d6 extra damage for each mirror that would also be able to target the target with the same attack.")
B.Vf=new A.m("feature_mirror_self_Shattering","Shattering","when one of your mirrors is destroyed, Deal the damage to each enemy range {Source} of the clone. Deal the reaction damage to enemies Range {source} of you.")
B.a4n=s([B.R8,B.TV,B.Vf],t.U)
B.WJ=new A.ah("feature_mirror_self","Mirror Self","[Action] Make {Source} copies of yourself that appear adjacent to you and last for as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever an attack targets you or a clone, you may choose to make a defense like normal or have the clone break. If broken, the clone is destroyed and the attack is otherwise ignored and the attacker takes {Half Source d6} damage. At the start of your turn, pick any of the copies to play out your turn from and you may move all your clones up to your speed whenever you move. Clones damaged from provoked attacks on your turn are destroyed instead of rolling to see who is hit, dealing {Half Source d6} damage to the attacker. If an attack targets multiple of your clones you can only defend for 1 of them.\n\n[Reaction] Before you make a defense check that isn\u2019t a Vitality Defense, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, You succeed the defense check and the attacker takes {Source d6}, On Problems you fail the defense.",B.al,B.a4n,!1)
B.TE=new A.m("feature_mischief_Cuteify","Cuteify","On Success with the action, on the start of target\u2019s turn make a status check vs cha, on success the target is disabled and the effect continues. On failure the effect ends.")
B.Sa=new A.m("feature_mischief_Glitter_Bomb","Glitter Bomb","Deal damage after moving the target and deal the damage to each enemy within 2 of the target.")
B.UX=new A.m("feature_mischief_Pants","Pants","On success, the target's speed is halved until they spend a [Reaction] to put their clothes right.")
B.a58=s([B.TE,B.Sa,B.UX],t.U)
B.Wv=new A.ah("feature_mischief","Mischief","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack against one enemy in range 6/12 vs Cha. On Success, they take {Source d8} Damage and you may force them to move {Source} spaces.\n\n[Reaction] End of an enemy\u2019s turn who is range 6, Spend your reaction and Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Cha and force them to move up to {Source} spaces.",B.D,B.a58,!1)
B.QD=new A.m("feature_missile_barrage_Big_One","Big One","The first missile deals {Half source d6} extra damage.")
B.QW=new A.m("feature_missile_barrage_Explosive","Explosive","You may force targets to dash 1 space per missile. You may target yourself or allies range 6, they resist the damage and are forced to dash {Half Source} spaces per missile instead.")
B.Tw=new A.m("feature_missile_barrage_Tracking","Tracking","On problems with the Action, You gain half of the missiles you would have had as tracking missiles that last until the end of your next turn. If you succeed on an attack or take the Missile reaction, you may distribute these tracking missiles to the targets to deal 1d6 damage. These missiles don\u2019t trigger the Big one.")
B.a3N=s([B.QD,B.QW,B.Tw],t.U)
B.WD=new A.ah("feature_missile_barrage","Missile Barrage","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs dex, On Success, Distribute {1 + Source} missiles between targets Range 6. Each target takes 1d6 Damage per missile.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and Distribute {1 + Half Source} Missiles between the targets of the triggering attack. Each target takes 1d6 damage per missile.",B.D,B.a3N,!1)
B.Su=new A.m("feature_mortar_Boom","Boom","On Success, Deal {source d12} damage to targets who are not prone instead. Targets may choose to drop prone before being attacked.")
B.Q_=new A.m("feature_mortar_Scooting","Scooting","During your turn, you may dash your mortar to a free space within {Source} of it.")
B.UA=new A.m("feature_mortar_Relay","Relay","[Reaction] Before an Ally makes an attack, you may spend your reaction and have them use a space within {Source} of your mortar as the origin of the ability and gain a +1 to attack results for that ability.")
B.a3M=s([B.Su,B.Q_,B.UA],t.U)
B.XC=new A.ah("feature_mortar","Mortar","[Action] During your or an Ally\u2019s Turns, Spend your reaction and Target a free space range 1 and setup and fire your Mortar. Your mortar counts as a Barrier as if made by a skill, and you may spend supply to do anything but make multiple mortars as if it was a barrier. As long as it lasts, You and your allies can spend a [Reaction] to target a 1 space radius range {Source *3} of the mortar, they make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, and on success deal {Source d8} damage.\n\nCover: [Reaction] After an ally range {2*Source} of your Mortar fails on an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, On Success deal {Source d8} to enemies in a 1 space radius that contains at least 1 space containing a target of the triggering attack.",B.D,B.a3M,!1)
B.RR=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Skippers","Skippers","For Enemies, On success Reduce their speed by {Half Source}. For Allies, On Success, Give them {Half Source} additional speed until the start of your turn. You may move your Mushrooms up to {Half Source} Spaces during each of your turns.")
B.Ry=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Stoners","Stoners","For Enemies, On Success: The enemy is stunned until the end of its turn but may not be stunned by stoners again this encounter. For Allies, On Success, The target has advantage on Int, Wis, and Cha defenses and disadvantage on concentration checks until the start of their next turn.")
B.Qn=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Creepers","Creepers","while concentrating, [Action] make the status check targeting every creature range 1 of the area.")
B.a3r=s([B.RR,B.Ry,B.Qn],t.U)
B.X4=new A.ah("feature_mushrooms","Mushrooms","[Action] Target a 1 space radius range 6 spaces, where mushrooms sprout from the ground. For as long as you remain concentrating, Whenever a creature starts their turn in the area or enters it for the first time on their turn, the mushrooms activate. For enemies, make a Status Check Vs Vit, On a Success, deal {Source d6} Damage. For Allies, make a Status Check, On Success, Heal {Source d6} HP.\n\nSpores [Reaction] During your or ally turns, Spend your reaction, and make a Status Check vs Vit. On Success, target all characters range 1 of the Triggering Character, Deal {Source d6} to Enemies and Heal {Source d6} to allies.",B.D,B.a3r,!1)
B.Uv=new A.m("feature_nightmare_Scream","Scream","When you fail the status check on a character with nightmares, make a status check vs cha targeting enemies within {Source} of the original target, excluding the original target. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.UB=new A.m("feature_nightmare_Monsters_Under_the_Bed","Monsters Under the Bed","When you succeed on the status check, deal 1d10 extra damage for each of your allies adjacent to the target.")
B.R7=new A.m("feature_nightmare_Crawling","Crawling","when you succeed on the status check, force the target to move {Half Source} ignoring the prone during the movement.")
B.a4J=s([B.Uv,B.UB,B.R7],t.U)
B.X8=new A.ah("feature_nightmare","Nightmare","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4. On success, the target is knocked prone and is trapped in nightmares and is stunned. While having nightmares, on the start of the target's turn, make a status check vs int, on success the target is stunned and takes {Source d8} damage. On failure the effect ends. If the target is attacked by you or your allies, the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] Start of an enemy turn who is range 4 of you and has you or one of your allies adjacent to it. Make a Ranged Attack vs Int. On success, the target is knocked prone, is stunned and has nightmares.",B.D,B.a4J,!1)
B.Qc=new A.m("feature_ninja_Shuriken","Shuriken","Before Disappear or Withdraw, make an Ranged Attack targeting 1 enemy range 3/6 vs dex, On Success, Deal {Source d8} Damage.")
B.V8=new A.m("feature_ninja_Shadow_Blade","Shadow Blade","After you Disappear or Withdraw, your next Melee Attack deals an extra {Half Source d8} damage.")
B.S_=new A.m("feature_ninja_Return","Return","Before Disappearing or Withdrawing, target 1 enemy range 1. During your next turn, you may teleport to a free space adjacent to the targeted enemy one time.")
B.a64=s([B.Qc,B.V8,B.S_],t.U)
B.Xu=new A.ah("feature_ninja","Ninja","Disappear: [Reaction] Start of any turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Source} spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to hide.\n\nWithdraw [Reaction] After you or an Ally makes an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Half Source} Spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to Hide.\n",B.al,B.a64,!1)
B.V2=new A.m("feature_ooze_Acidic","Acidic","[Reaction] When damaged by an attack while concentrating on ooze, spend your reaction to Make an Status Check Vs Vit and target absorbed enemies and adjacent enemies. On a Success deal {Source d6} damage. If you fail to concentrate, this effect still occurs.")
B.RW=new A.m("feature_ooze_First_Hunter","First Hunter","You have advantage on concentration checks caused by targets, and +1 to defense results from attacks made by the targets.")
B.V4=new A.m("feature_ooze_Amoeba","Amoeba","While Concentrating, You cannot be flanked, and you suffer no speed penalty for squeezing. At the start of your turn, you and the targets all dash {Half Source} spaces to free spaces where you can all fit and the targets are still all range 1 of you.")
B.a5H=s([B.V2,B.RW,B.V4],t.U)
B.XD=new A.ah("feature_ooze","Ooze","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting enemies range 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to each target and absorb the targets as long as you remain concentrating. While absorbed you and the targets are restrained, and at the start of your turn, Deal {Half Source d6} damage to each target and heal {Half Source d6}. You have a +1 to concentration check results caused by the targets.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends range 1 or after they miss you with a melee attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting the enemy. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and absorb the target as long as you remain concentrating.",B.D,B.a5H,!1)
B.RY=new A.m("feature_parry_Duelers_Dance","Dueler\u2019s Dance","On Success with your parry, You may move up to {Source} Spaces without provoking attacks. Then force the target into a free space adjacent to you.")
B.TW=new A.m("feature_parry_Protecting","Protecting","When an Ally is attacked by an enemy who is in range, you may parry the attack. On a miss, the ally still makes a defense against the attack.")
B.a74=s([B.RY,B.TW],t.U)
B.XE=new A.ah("feature_parry","Parry","Parry [Reaction] If an enemy range 1 would attack you, You may spend your reaction to make an Attack roll. On Success, Deal {Source d10} damage and the Enemy attack misses. On a miss, the attack succeeds against you. You may use a weapon instead targeting within the weapons reach, and dealing the weapon\u2019s damage ignoring the weapon\u2019s technique.\n\nPrepare [Action] Until the start of your next turn, you may parry {source} times without spending your reaction.",B.D,B.a74,!1)
B.U8=new A.m("feature_pin_Executioner","Executioner","When allies hit your pin target, they deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.")
B.VJ=new A.m("feature_pin_Guard_Master","Guard Master","At the end of a grappled enemies adjacent to you turn, instead of them moving in the grapple, you may move them in the grapple instead. ")
B.Ra=new A.m("feature_pin_Limb_Lock","Limb Lock","While Pinning, Enemies adjacent to you have disadvantage on attacks against you and to escape grapple. You have disadvantage on attacks against the targets of your Pinning.")
B.a3f=s([B.U8,B.VJ,B.Ra],t.U)
B.Wg=new A.ah("feature_pin","Pin","Pin [Action, 2 Unarmed] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} and you grapple the target and have pinning as long as you remain grappling. While Pinning, enemies adjacent to you grant your allies advantage when making Attacks from outside the grapple against the target rather than disadvantage. If they roll 2 failures they attack you instead. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts its turn adjacent to you or becomes adjacent, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and grapple the target and gain pinning as long as you remain grappling.",B.D,B.a3f,!1)
B.Rm=new A.m("feature_poppet_Eyes","Eyes","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on ranged attacks and defense checks caused by attacks from non adjacent attackers.")
B.SY=new A.m("feature_poppet_Heart","Heart","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] deal {Half Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance. ")
B.U9=new A.m("feature_poppet_Junk","Junk","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] the target must make a concentration check with disadvantage if concentrating. Until the start of your next turn, reduce the target's speed by {Source} to no less than 1.")
B.a5W=s([B.Rm,B.SY,B.U9],t.U)
B.XB=new A.ah("feature_poppet","Poppet","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Cha targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Source d8} damage and you make a poppet of the target that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, you and your allies have a +1 to attack results against the target and +1 to defense results caused by the target. The poppet requires a hand to wield.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds with a melee attack during their turn and has a free hand, spend your reaction and create a poppet for 1 of the targets. If an ally is the triggering character, you still concentrate on the poppet even when they are holding it.",B.D,B.a5W,!1)
B.Tg=new A.m("feature_puppet_Guilt","Guilt","When your puppet succeeds in attacking one of their allies, The puppet takes {Source d8} Damage.")
B.SN=new A.m("feature_puppet_BodyGuard","BodyGuard","[Reaction] When an attack would target you, you may spend your reaction to teleport your puppet to a free space adjacent to you and it becomes the target of the attack instead.")
B.RS=new A.m("feature_puppet_Distant_Strings","Distant Strings","The attack becomes Ranged with a range becomes {2*Source} /{4*Source}. If you Succeed on an attack at the long range, you have advantage on your first {Source} Status Checks vs the Target.")
B.a6S=s([B.Tg,B.SN,B.RS],t.U)
B.X0=new A.ah("feature_puppet","Puppet","[Action] Melee Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range {Source}, On Success: The target is your puppet as long as you remain concentrating. On the Start of Its Turn, Make an Status Check Vs Int, On Success: You may have the target move up to its speed and use a single Innate Action, [Chump Action], or Skill in combat action against a target of your choice. On a Miss: The target is stunned and the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally Succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int, On Success the target becomes your puppet for as long as you remain concentrating.",B.D,B.a6S,!1)
B.Vp=new A.m("feature_rain_Ice_Storm","Ice Storm","On Success, Give targeted enemies {Source /3} cold. While Concentrating, At the start of your Turn, Make an Status Check vs Wis, On Success, enemies in the area gain {Source /3} cold.")
B.Tl=new A.m("feature_rain_Wandering_Storm","Wandering Storm","While Concentrating, At the Start of the Round, you may move your rain area {Source} Spaces.")
B.Ve=new A.m("feature_rain_Soothing_Rain","Soothing Rain","when an ally ends their turn in the area they gain {Source d6} shield. This includes the bonus to gaining shields in the area.")
