B.WU=new A.ah("feature_rain","Rain","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Wis, targeting enemies in a 1 space radius range 6. On Success, they take {Source d8} Damage. Regardless, the area remains under a rain cloud as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever an enemy in the area is attacked, they take an extra {half Source d6} damage. Whenever an ally in the area gains shield or heals, increase the amount by {Half Source d6}.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds on an Attack during their turn, spend your reaction and place a 1 space radius rain cloud so that at least 1 of the spaces of a target of the triggering attack is in the radius that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. Apply the bonus damage to the triggering attack.",B.D,B.a66,!1)
