B.WZ=new A.ah("feature_rot","Rot","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack Vs Vit targeting an enemy range 6/12: On Success, deal {Source d8} damage and begin concentrating. As long as you remain concentrating, When the target would gain HP or Shield they do not. While Concentrating, If you use this ability again, you may add targets to the concentration.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy range 6 would heal or gain shield, Spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Vit. On success, the target doesn\u2019t heal or gain shield and takes {Source d6} damage.",B.D,B.a6y,!1)
