B.Sp=new A.m("feature_sanctuary_Sleepy","Sleepy","When allies gain rest, If they are prone or choose to drop prone, they gain both benefits. When an ally in the sanctuary benefits from the extra healing or shield, they may drop prone to gain {Source d6} extra instead.")
