B.VU=new A.ah("feature_spirit","Spirit","[Action] Target an unoccupied square within 6 spaces, and summon your Spirit. As long as you remain concentrating, When you use the ability and as a [Reaction] on following turns, you may move your spirit Companion up to 6 spaces ignoring Difficult terrain, and make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting enemies range 1. On Success Deal {Source d10} Damage ignoring shields and resistance. \n\nYour Spirit can be anything as long but takes up the space of a medium creature. It uses your defenses when attacked, and you take half of all damage that would be dealt to the spirit. This damage cannot be reduced in any way. You do not make concentration checks from damage to your companion. Allies and the spirit may flank.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction and summon your spirit in an unoccupied space within 6\n",B.D,B.a5S,!1)
