B.TQ=new A.m("feature_whirlwind_Protector","Protector","On success, you may dash allies in range to free spaces in range. Until the start of your next turn allies in range gain +1 to defenses.")
B.UP=new A.m("feature_whirlwind_Tornado","Tornado","On success, after dealing damage you may dash up to {Half Source} then dash all targets to a free space in range.")
B.VF=new A.m("feature_whirlwind_Storm","Storm","On Success, until the start of your next turn spaces within 2 of you are difficult terrain for enemies and you have a +1 to defenses from ranged attacks.")
