B.Xj=new A.ah("feature_wraith","Wraith","[Action] Dash {Half Source} then make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting 1 enemy range 3. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and this damage ignores shield and resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally range 6 succeed with a Melee attack during their turn, spend your reaction and Deal {Source/3 d6} damage vs Wis, and this damage and the triggering attack\u2019s damage ignores Shield and Resistance.",B.D,B.a7t,!1)
