B.a1A=new A.cc("implement_weapon_melee","Melee Weapon","You may use a specific type of weapon as an implement. Gain +1 to results to Concentration checks caused by Melee Attacks.",B.ij)
B.a1q=new A.cc("implement_weapon_ranged","Ranged Weapon","You may use a specific type of weapon as an implement. Gain +1/+2 Range on Ranged Attacks.",B.ij)
B.a1k=new A.cc("implement_Binoculars","Binoculars","Range +1/2 [Reaction] When there isn't any enemies adjacent to you and an enemy you can see attacks your allies and not you, you may spend your reaction to give all your allies targeted advantage on the check.",B.ct)
B.a1e=new A.cc("implement_Wand","Wand","When you Hit an Enemy who is 3 or fewer spaces away with a Ranged Attack, You deal {Level /4 d6} Extra damage.",B.cb)
B.a1t=new A.cc("implement_Phone","Phone","Proxy [Reaction] When you make an Attack and there are no enemies adjacent to you, you may spend your reaction to target the ability from the location of an ally.",B.cb)
B.a1D=new A.cc("implement_Charger","Charger","Before or After your [Action] target an ally within 1 with an ability, either you or the ally may reduce their shield to give it to the other.",B.cb)
B.a1p=new A.cc("implement_Book","Book","Gain +1 to Results of Concentration Checks caused by damage.",B.cb)
B.a1E=new A.cc("implement_Ritual_Knife","Ritual Knife","When you succeed with a Status Check, you may Pay {Level /4 d6} HP to do {Level /4 d12} extra damage to all targets.",B.cb)
B.a1h=new A.cc("implement_Orb","Orb","[Reaction] When you miss with a Status Check. You may spend your reaction to reroll the check. If you now succeed deal {Level/4 d6} damage to the targets in addition to the other effects.",B.cb)
B.a1c=new A.cc("implement_Symbol_of_Sacrifice","Symbol of Sacrifice","Before or After your [Action], you may pay HP and give it to an ally range 1.",B.cb)
B.a1v=new A.cc("implement_Symbol_of_Healing","Symbol of Healing","[Reaction] When you miss a status check to heal an ally, you may spend you reaction to reroll. If you then succeed, heal the targets {Level /4 d6} extra.",B.cb)
B.a1j=new A.cc("implement_Symbol_of_Vengeance","Symbol of Vengeance","When you Attack an Enemy who has damaged one of your allies this round, deal {Level/4 d6} extra damage.",B.cb)
B.a1u=new A.cc("implement_Bones","Bones","After you succeed on a Status check, until the end of your next turn, Your allies gain +1 to attack results against the targets.",B.cb)
B.a1g=new A.cc("implement_Teeth","Teeth","After you succeed on an attack, choose 1 of the targets. Until the end of your next turn, you may target your [Action] from that enemy's space.",B.cb)
B.a1o=new A.cc("implement_Dice","Dice","When you get Problems on an Attack roll, you may roll 2d6. If you roll a 7, succeed instead and deal 2d6 extra damage. If you roll 2, deal 2d6 damage to yourself.",B.cb)
B.a1i=new A.cc("implement_Tome","Tome","Gain +1 to Results of Concentration Checks caused by damage.\n[Reaction] After you fail a concentration check, you may spend your reaction to reroll the check.",B.ct)
B.a1d=new A.cc("implement_Staff","Staff","When you use an action, If there aren't any enemies adjacent to you, you may target the ability as if you were standing in a free space within 2 of you.",B.ct)
B.a1r=new A.cc("implement_Keyboard_Pants","Keyboard Pants","Range +1/+2 [Action], your next {Level /2} attacks using your [Action] gains the Proxy effect as if you had spent a reaction. Proxy [Reaction] When you make an Attack and there are no enemies adjacent to you, you may spend your reaction to target the ability from the location of an ally.",B.ct)
B.a1y=new A.cc("implement_Charging_Cable","Charging Cable","Before or After your [Action], Target an Ally within 3 and either you or the ally may reduce their shield to give it to the other. [Reaction] During an allies turn who is within 3, you may spend your reaction either you or the ally may reduce their shield to give it to the other.",B.ct)
B.a1x=new A.cc("implement_Rod","Rod","When you attack a target that you succeeded in attacking with a rod last round, gain a +1 to attack results and deal {Level /4 d6} bonus damage.",B.ct)
B.a1s=new A.cc("implement_Totem","Totem","Before or After your [Action], place your totem in your space or a space within 1. Until you next turn, your allies in your totem location gain +1 to Defense results.",B.ct)
B.a1w=new A.cc("implement_Blood","Blood","After you succeed on a Melee Attack, gain {Level /3} blood. When you use an [Action] to make a Melee Attack, you may spend 1 blood to target 1 enemy in the situation instead.",B.ct)
B.a1l=new A.cc("implement_Cards","Cards","Once a Round, When you fail a check, you may draw from a standard 52 card deck. On a black card you succeed instead, on a Red you fail, On Joker, fall prone. Shuffle the deck at the start of each situation.",B.ct)
B.a1n=new A.cc("implement_Tarot","Tarot Cards","Once a Round, When an ally fail a check, Draw a Tarot card, If its a Wand or Sword, they succeed. If its a Major arcana, they succeed and gain {Half Level d6} shield. Shuffle the deck at the start of each situation.",B.ct)
B.a1C=new A.cc("implement_Horn","Horn, Instrument","Horning [Reaction]: When an enemy within 6 makes an Attack, You may spend your reaction to give you and all allies targeted by the attack gain a +1 to defense results.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.cb)
B.a1m=new A.cc("implement_chant","Chant, Instrument","Chant [Reaction] When you fail a concentration check to maintain a feature that targets an ally, you or any ally you can see may spend their reaction to allow you to reroll the check with a +1 bonus to the result. Your team may pay to reroll any number of times.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.cb)
B.a1z=new A.cc("implement_Bass","Bass, Instrument","Jammin': When you use a feature targeting enemies that have been hit by one of your allies' attacks this round, gain a +1 bonus to results of attacks against the targets.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.ct)
B.a1f=new A.cc("implement_Guitar","Guitar, Instrument","Solo: end of round, any enemy you attacked who wasn't attacked by one of your allies takes {Power} damage.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.ct)
B.a1B=new A.cc("implement_Drums","Drums, Instrument","Before or After your [Action], Target an Ally within 6 and force them to dash 1 space.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.ct)
